    "title": "Photo Video Maker with Music",
    "description": "Photo Video Maker with Music is your all-in-one video slideshow maker to make video with pictures and music. Instead of simple photos, this video editing app allows you to combine multiple photos into 1 photo video collage, integrated with your favorite music songs. \r\n\r\nLet\u2019s turn the music video into a video slideshow maker with music,  your best photos and animations or stickers. You can create a story video & movie maker from pictures and music using a photo video slideshow maker with song. Using our Photo Video Maker with Music, you can also easily add music to video. \r\n\r\nWhile using this slideshow maker with music, to easily share with friends and post on social networking sites, you can create music videos with photos of short duration such as reel maker, story maker. etc...\r\n\r\nCreate photo video with music at NO FEE & 100% No Watermark\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Create photo slideshow with music and photos at your camera & gallery\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Slideshow maker with music and effects professionally\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Collage photos video maker\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Add perfect background, music and Animation, Text, Stickers\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Extract sound from music videos\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Trim video & Video cutter & video merger\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Select the appropriate transition video effects for the photos\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Edit photos right in the photo video maker\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Export videos from the music video maker\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Add music to video or any audios files you want\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Change video speed: faster and slower\r\n\ud83d\udca5 No watermark \r\n\ud83d\udca5 Export high-quality video\r\n\ud83c\udf08 Photo video editor with songs\r\n\r\nWith just a few seconds, this slideshow maker allows you to create your own music photo video with trending effects, add quotes and lovely stickers \r\n\u270f Choose min 3 photos\r\n\u270f Add music to video or audio files\r\n\u270f Add text or sticker, choose suitable frame and background\r\n\u270f Adjust speed, slow motion effects, transition and animations if you want\r\n\u270f Export video with high quality\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf Reels maker, story maker and short movie editor\r\nWith this photo video maker, to easily share on social media with short videos, you can create reels, stories with music photos. You can directly edit photos right on video, add songs you like and use all professional video editing effects. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf83 Photo Slideshow maker through which you can create slideshow and movies from your mobile. A variety of slide timing, frames and filters or hottest sticker effects. Adding text with many fonts and styles are also supported in Photo Video Maker with Music. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca2 Extract sound from Video\r\n\r\nWhile using our photo video maker, you can easily export audio files from existing video shops without the need for another conversion application. Just a few simple steps with this \r\n music video maker, you will quickly receive audio files.\r\n\r\nAnd, if you are looking for a useful tool to add music to video that helps video editing with music and photos simply but professionally, we highly recommend this video editor music app. Explore Photo Video Maker with Music now so you will not miss the excellent features to create an outstanding music photo video\r\n\r\nDon't forget to suggest this photo video maker to your friends so they can create videos quickly. Have a nice day!",
